 * @file http3_msh3_backend
 * @brief Bounded decoded HTTP/3 server adapter for the msh3/MsQuic backend.
 *
 * This optional header requires msh3.h and is intended for targets that link
 * msh3. msh3 owns QUIC, TLS 1.3, QPACK, and HTTP/3 frame processing; NTL owns
 * message bounds, callback lifetime, request dispatch, and fail-closed
 * response validation.
